  "scope": "Exact durable preparation and all seven concrete output files are independently re-admitted under one genuine native/upload scope before a fresh decision. Every actual old writer retires before exclusion release; canonical cleanup is awaited without self-wait. Failed actual lease cleanup retries without native revival. A genuine full native/packet witness survives temporary-reader cleanup and checks after the final authority callback. A real late pending-intent change refuses retirement, retains the new intent and leaves all seven actual old writers live. Complete older-but-native-valid output refuses against retained LIVE. Concrete replacement participants preserve both native histories, document bytes and future Undo/Redo. Successful retirement does not rewrite source rows or immutable inputs; host-authored late intent survives refused retirement. Attached metadata writers and factories fence actual native retirement before record staging and across asynchronous opening. A genuine revision-closing notification cannot alter sibling intent after core retirement. All four native history pairs preserve readable exports and captured persistence cleanup. Active document read-only retains its metadata operations.",
